  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Brand introduction:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Tim &amp; Tam is a brand dedicated to producing thoughtfully created quality baby and kids&rsquo; products to solve problems.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The MANE by Tim &amp; Tam range of fitted sheets was created by our founder to solve a problem - The problem was that she knew that the cotton sheets her baby was sleeping on was contributing to her little one&rsquo;s hair loss, hair breakage and balding. She knew it was tugging at her baby&rsquo;s little hair follicles and stripping her baby&rsquo;s skin and hair of natural oils and products she had applied. After trying to tuck in her satin scarves on top of her little one&rsquo;s mattress she observed that the satin scarf would shift during the night and decided there must be a better safer solution! Our MANE by TIM &amp; TAM Fitted Sheets were thoughtfully designed with highest quality Oeko certified fabrics including organic cotton and Silky Soft Satin to solve this problem.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Product description:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">TIM &amp; TAM brings you the MANE range of Satin fitted SINGLE, COTBED, COT, CRIB and MOSES BASKET sheets and Satin Pillowcases that will ensure your little bundle of joy sleeps safely and comfortably through the night while PROTECTING their HAIR and SKIN.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The SATIN used in our sheets provide a smooth sleep surface which skin and hair gently glide across as your baby has a peaceful rest. It reduces friction as its low absorbency leaves your little one&rsquo;s delicate skin and hair hydrated. This is key in helping to prevent frizzy knotty hair, hair breakage, baldness, and dry skin. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Payment terms:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>Monthly Paypal transfers</p>",
